    "detailed_description": "Idle Atomic is an Incremental Idle RPG in a post-apocalyptic world.<br><br>You stand alone in the wasteland and must fight monsters, salvage resources and refine materials to survive! <br><br>Key features:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/d367e13969dcd4712bcea0f66a8b5b32.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/d367e13969dcd4712bcea0f66a8b5b32.webm?t=1709315211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>- Defeat monsters, gain power, unlock new zones and hunt down bounties!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/b16d9708189d8e859ce5ac5ccd6b87c0.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/b16d9708189d8e859ce5ac5ccd6b87c0.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>- Gather a large variety of loot and discover rare salvaging spawns!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/16521db5a4ab355aafa162813fa3e139.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/16521db5a4ab355aafa162813fa3e139.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>- Use resources gathered to refine materials, craft permanent power-ups and suit upgrades, enhance item efficiency and more!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/269a4cd73de01acd9385ad97f8ffdd0d.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/269a4cd73de01acd9385ad97f8ffdd0d.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>- Unlock and cast fighting and utility spells, discover unique essence to enhance your spells!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/0c21fd582cc70a309d0a795fa01eeb84.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/0c21fd582cc70a309d0a795fa01eeb84.webm?t=1709315211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>- Hunt 20+ mutant creatures that appear during gameplay, each with their own loot table!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/c730c0c2cb5d2012d3849f887fc95f5f.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/c730c0c2cb5d2012d3849f887fc95f5f.webm?t=1709315211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>- Earn and level up companions to unlock powerful bonuses!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/a36f9fd7d31ad8186c4fa6b164e2e9d6.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/a36f9fd7d31ad8186c4fa6b164e2e9d6.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br> - Complete various Tasks and Missions to unlock stat enhancements!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/c110da1e4e9c8a776d08ca791ab53704.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/c110da1e4e9c8a776d08ca791ab53704.webm?t=1709315211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>- Find and use items to make yourself more powerful and provide helpful utilities!  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/60aaac29b18037015eb36b5118822bfc.poster.avif?t=1709315211\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658620/extras/60aaac29b18037015eb36b5118822bfc.apng?t=1709315211\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>- Idle Wasteland has a plethora of content, play the game to discover much more!",
